# -----------------------------
# Data policy
# -----------------------------
# Ignore all raw data by default…
data/**
# …but keep a small, reviewable subset so the project runs out-of-the-box:
!data/
!data/restaurants_all.jsonl
!data/restaurant_*.jsonl
data/reviews_googleplus.jsonl
data/reviews.clean.json
data/reviews_*.jsonl


# -----------------------------
# Outputs
# -----------------------------
# Keep outputs versioned so results are visible in the repo UI.
